	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-10\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--hard-conversion title-c--nero link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-pate_los_21-images-38-10.png\" alt=\"COMPLETE WET FOOD\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h1>COMPLETE WET FOOD - LICK YOUR PAWS CLEAN!</h1><p>Choosing the right cat food is important and you need to consider many aspects. It should be tasty but also carry healthy benefits. <strong>Do you choose kibble or wet food? Well, why not both?</strong> The kibble is available all day for your fluffy housemate, while the wet food in turn provides a daily culinary highlight. Cats just love wet food!</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-81\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--white txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h2>HEALTH BENEFITS OF WET FOOD FOR CATS</h2><h4>✔️ Delectable and full flavour</h4><p>Cats are known for their fussy eating habits. Wet food has a more pleasant smell and taste for cats than dry food, which makes it very appealing to them. If your cat is culinary hard to please, wet food may be the solution to stimulate her appetite. Sounds purrr-fect!</p><h4>✔️ Increases fluid intake</h4><p>Cats generally don’t drink much. Our pâté contains a high moisture content (&gt;80%). This makes it the ideal food to increase your cat's fluid intake and pamper your cat in a healthy and responsible way!</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h4>✔️ Healthy urinary tract through increased fluid intake</h4><p>The high moisture content in our pâté makes urine thinner and less concentrated. This is important to prevent bladder stones and other urinary tract problems.</p><h4>✔️ Weight management</h4><p>Another added benefit of more moisture: it means a less calorific meal while offering a greater sense of satiety. Win-win!</p><h4>✔️ Healthy digestion</h4><p>Consuming wet food makes stools softer. This is especially important for cats that don’t drink enough.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-82\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--center pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>VOSKES PATÉ IS FOR CATS<br>OF ALL AGES</h1><p>Voskes paté is <strong>available for kittens, adult cats and slightly older cats</strong>, with the food adapted to the specific needs of your cat's life stage.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n                </div>\n\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-40\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--chicken link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-voskes_pate_voor_kittens2-images-38-40.png\" alt=\"VOSKES PATÉ FOR KITTENS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>VOSKES PATÉ FOR KITTENS</h3><p>This soft paté with chicken &amp; fine pieces of carrot is ideal for growing kittens. Kittens are playful rompers and need lots of high-energy food. The paté contains 40% chicken and is enriched with extra chicken protein for optimal growth.</p><a href=\"/products/kitten-pate-chicken-with-carrots\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-41\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--salmon link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-voskes_pate_voor_heek1-images-38-41.png\" alt=\"VOSKES PATÉ FOR ADULT CATS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>VOSKES PATÉ FOR ADULT CATS</h3><p>Our paté for adult cats is enriched with sea buckthorn, a source of natural antioxidants that supports immunity. In addition, this cat food contains krill meal. This is packed with high-quality proteins, amino acids and essential fats. Our Voskes adult paté consists of 3 flavours, so that both fish and meat lovers' needs are met.</p><a href=\"/cat-food/complete-wet-food.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">Discover the different flavours</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-42\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--tuna link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-voskes_pate_voor_senior1-images-38-42.png\" alt=\"VOSKES PATÉ FOR SENIOR CATS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>VOSKES PATÉ FOR SENIOR CATS</h3><p>Slightly older cats need more fibre-rich food to support their digestion. That is why we have added lignocellulose in our paté for senior cats. This is a good source of fibre that also provides better absorption of all nutrients and ensures good digestion. Older cats also have more joint problems. Therefore, eggshell membrane was added as a source of collagen, good for cartilage &amp; joints.</p><a href=\"/products/pate-tuna-with-cod-green-beans\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">مشاهده محصول</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-87\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--transparent txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero bg-img\" style=\"\n          --bg-mobile: url('/uploads/bg_mobile/bg_mobile-banner_bos_kat_flesh_wir1-bg_image-34-87.png');\n          --bg-tablet: url('/uploads/bg_tablet/bg_tablet-banner_bos_kat_flesh_wir1-bg_image-34-87.png');\n          --bg-desktop: url('/uploads/bg_desktop/bg_desktop-banner_bos_kat_flesh_wir1-bg_image-34-87.png');\n          --bg-retina: url('/uploads/bg_retina/bg_retina-banner_bos_kat_flesh_wir1-bg_image-34-87.png');\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h2>PACKAGED IN CONVENIENT &amp; DURABLE PACKAGING</h2><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width: 25%;\" src=\"https://sanux.100.nl/uploads/voskes.nl/v2/original/tetra_pak_–_1.png\" alt=\"PACKAGED IN CONVENIENT &amp; DURABLE PACKAGING\"></p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p>You can buy Voskes paté in <strong>8 x 95 g tetra portion packs.</strong> This handy pack is easy to open and dose: 1 carton = 1 meal. No fuss!</p><p>In addition, our tetra briquettes are a sustainable alternative to canned food. The tetra pack has a carbon footprint as much as 81% lower than other packaging and is 100% recyclable! Talk about cat-tastic news!</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-43\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-foto_pate_katten_–_11-images-38-43.png\" alt=\"THE NUMEROUS BENEFITS OF VOSKES PATÉ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>THE NUMEROUS BENEFITS OF VOSKES PATÉ:</h2><ul><li><strong>Available in 5 different flavours</strong></li><li><strong>Ideal for combining wet and dry feeding</strong></li><li><strong>Handy and sustainable packaging</strong></li><li><strong>100% natural ingredients, suitable for human consumption</strong></li><li><strong>No artificial colours, flavours and preservatives</strong></li><li><strong>Completely grain-free</strong></li><li><strong>High moisture content &gt;80%</strong></li><li><strong>Suitable for every cat and age due to addition of specific ingredients</strong></li></ul></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
